{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794546222909,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7b3d5ffeOOZ1uunf8eAcfG","part":{"partID":"prt_1d34a3f20002jSaq2fmJ6KlCCg","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7b3d5ffeOOZ1uunf8eAcfG","messageID":"msg_1d34a32ef001H8h6CyRcs6e5OA","type":"tool","id":"call_72775f171c6341dca3af075e","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md","oldString":"4. **Instruction file:** `embed` adds the shipped sections to your project's own `AGENTS.md`. `link` points `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `REPO RULES.md` at the checkout's copies.","newString":"4. **Instruction file:** `embed` adds the shipped sections to your project's own `AGENTS.md` and leaves a one-line `CLAUDE.md` reading `@AGENTS.md`, because Claude Code reads only `CLAUDE.md`. `link` points `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `REPO RULES.md` at the checkout's copies."},"output":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"INSTALL-SKILLED.md","patch":"Index: INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n===================================================================\n--- INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n+++ INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n@@ -129,9 +129,9 @@\n \n 1. **Target repo:** the absolute path of your project.\n 2. **Runtimes:** the AI coding tools you use. Pick any of `claude`, `opencode`, `codex`, `cursor`, `devin` and `pi`.\n 3. **Link shape:** choose `auto`. [What Gets Linked](#what-gets-linked) explains the shapes.\n-4. **Instruction file:** `embed` adds the shipped sections to your project's own `AGENTS.md`. `link` points `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `REPO RULES.md` at the checkout's copies.\n+4. **Instruction file:** `embed` adds the shipped sections to your project's own `AGENTS.md` and leaves a one-line `CLAUDE.md` reading `@AGENTS.md`, because Claude Code reads only `CLAUDE.md`. `link` points `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `REPO RULES.md` at the checkout's copies.\n \n <!-- readme-check\n allow-ref CLAUDE.md | the instruction file in the operator's target repo, which this checkout does not ship\n -->\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md\",\"oldString\":\"4. **Instruction file:** `embed` adds the shipped sections to your project's own `AGENTS.md`. `link` points `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `REPO RULES.md` at the checkout's copies.\",\"newString\":\"4. **Instruction file:** `embed` adds the shipped sections to your project's own `AGENTS.md` and leaves a one-line `CLAUDE.md` reading `@AGENTS.md`, because Claude Code reads only `CLAUDE.md`. `link` points `AGENTS.md`, `CLAUDE.md` and `REPO RULES.md` at the checkout's copies.\"}"},"time":{"start":1794546220832,"end":1794546222909}}}}
{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794546222918,"sessionID":"ses_e2cb7b3d5ffeOOZ1uunf8eAcfG","part":{"partID":"prt_1d34a436c001paXFR9WAfEA38K","sessionID":"ses_e2cb7b3d5ffeOOZ1uunf8eAcfG","messageID":"msg_1d34a32ef001H8h6CyRcs6e5OA","type":"tool","id":"call_e65748be27194c47bc679494","tool":"edit","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"path":"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md","oldString":"| 2 | `/doctor:agents-md embed --root <dir>` | the checkout | Adds the shipped sections to your `AGENTS.md`. Skip it if you chose `link` |","newString":"| 2 | `/doctor:agents-md embed --root <dir>` | the checkout | Adds the shipped sections to your `AGENTS.md` and leaves the CLAUDE.md pointer. Skip it if you chose `link` |"},"output":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)","title":"edit","metadata":{"metadata":{"files":[{"file":"INSTALL-SKILLED.md","patch":"Index: INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n===================================================================\n--- INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n+++ INSTALL-SKILLED.md\n@@ -142,9 +142,9 @@\n \n | Step | Command | Run it from | What it does |\n | --- | --- | --- | --- |\n | 1 | `/doctor:symlink link --root <dir> --runtimes <list> --mode auto` | the checkout | Links `.skilled` and your runtime folders into the project |\n-| 2 | `/doctor:agents-md embed --root <dir>` | the checkout | Adds the shipped sections to your `AGENTS.md`. Skip it if you chose `link` |\n+| 2 | `/doctor:agents-md embed --root <dir>` | the checkout | Adds the shipped sections to your `AGENTS.md` and leaves the CLAUDE.md pointer. Skip it if you chose `link` |\n | 3 | `/doctor:mcp install` | the checkout | Builds and registers Code Mode, the bridge your runtime uses to call MCP tools |\n | 4 | `/doctor:git setup` | your project | Checks the git hooks and sk-git settings. Run `/doctor:git standards` afterwards to write repo-owned commit, PR and branch rules; until then the shipped defaults apply |\n | 5 | `/doctor:skill-advisor embedder` | your project | Sets up meaning matching for commands. It shows the cost and asks before it pulls the model or starts the server |\n | 6 | `/doctor:setup` | your project | Confirms the whole setup works |\n","status":"modified","additions":1,"deletions":1}],"truncated":false},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"Edited INSTALL-SKILLED.md (1 replacement)"}],"providerCall":{"executed":false},"providerResult":{"executed":false},"rawInput":"{\"path\":\"/Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research/INSTALL-SKILLED.md\",\"oldString\":\"| 2 | `/doctor:agents-md embed --root <dir>` | the checkout | Adds the shipped sections to your `AGENTS.md`. Skip it if you chose `link` |\",\"newString\":\"| 2 | `/doctor:agents-md embed --root <dir>` | the checkout | Adds the shipped sections to your `AGENTS.md` and leaves the CLAUDE.md pointer. Skip it if you chose `link` |\"}"},"time":{"start":1794546221932,"end":1794546222918}}}}
